We can choose any of the two sides of the parallelogram as a base, the other side is the corresponding height.  Note that $\| \mathbf{v} + \mathbf{w} - \mathbf{w} \| = \|\mathbf{v}\|.$  As a base, we could choose $\mathbf{v} + \mathbf{w}.$

